<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1361448" n="1"/>
  <opener> Illustriss. Doctissimoque Viro
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolao Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D<supplied>.</supplied></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Petrus <abbr>Ant.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr> Michelotti</rs></opener>
  <p><lb/>Pergrat<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> mihi fuerunt responsiones quas ad meas
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stiones tuis <abbr>eruditiss.</abbr> <rs key="B_991170517054605501" type="letter">literis</rs> <abbr>d.</abbr> <date when="1718-06-08">8 Junii</date> dedisti.
      <lb/>Perplacet solutio problematis de inveniendo frus<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>to conico quod inter <choice><orig><g ref="#omn">õ</g></orig><reg>omn</reg></choice>ia eiusdem basis et altitudinis
      <lb/>minimam patitur resistentiam si secundum longi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tudinem axis data cum velocitate in fluido mo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>veatur.<del> Video quam difficile sit applicare</del> Demonstra<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tionem quam mihi communicasti, in Tui honorem
      <lb/>me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_BS83R2A4">dissertationi</rs> addam occasione expositionis
      <lb/>doctrin<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Motus Fluidorum per arterias qua repre<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>hendam <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-117659606">Cheyn<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>um</rs>. Interim tametsi demonstratio
      <lb/><rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118587544">Newtoniana</rs> supponat figuras moveri in Fluidis
      <lb/>raris, non continuis quorum partes quiescunt; et
      <lb/>Fluida qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice><del> move</del> impingunt in ipsas figuras par<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tes habere eius indolis ut antecedentes subse<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>quentibus non sint impedimento: nihilominus pro<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>blema ita proponi potest. Invenire frustum co<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nicum concavum quod inter omnia eiusdem
      <lb/>basis et altitudinis minim<unclear>a</unclear> resistentiam objiciat
      <lb/>Fluido <add>gravi</add> continuo (cuius partes antecedentes succeden<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tibus nonnihil reluctentur ita ut liberam earundem
      <lb/>reflexionem non permittant aut turbent.) <unclear>inventi</unclear>
      <lb/>secundum axem frusti conici ad partes verticis trun<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>
<pb facs="1361450" n="2"/>
      <lb break="no"/>cati dat<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> velocitate.
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-118587544" type="person">Newtonus</rs> enim Scholio
      <lb/>post <rs key="biblio_6CP8LL78" type="biblio"><abbr>prop.</abbr> XXXV <abbr>lib.</abbr> <abbr>secund.</abbr> <abbr>Edit.</abbr> <abbr>sec.</abbr></rs> ita scribit.</p>
  <p><lb/><quote type="long"><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>In hac propositione exposui resistentiam et retar<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>dationem Projectilium Sph<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ricorum in Mediis non
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>continuis, et ostendi quod h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c resistentia sit ad vim
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>qua totus<del> Globus</del> Globi motus vel tolli possit vel<del> re-</del>
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice><del>tardari </del>generari quo tempore Globus duas tertias dia<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>metri su<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> partes, velocitate uniformiter continuata
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>describat, ut densitas Medii ad densitatem Globi, si
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>modo Globus et particul<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Medii sint summe elasti<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>ca et vi maxima reflectendi polleant: quodque h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>vis sit duplo minor ubi Globus et particul<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Medii
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>sunt infinite dura, et vi reflectendi prorsus desti<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice><del><gap/> </del>tuta. In mediis autem<del> non</del> continuis, qualia
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>sunt Aqua, Oleum calidum, Argentum vivum,
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>in quibus Globus non incidit immediate in omnes
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>fluidi particulas resistentiam generantes, sed
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>premit tantum proximas particulas et h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> premunt
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>alias et h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> alias, resistentia est adhuc duplo minor.</quote></p>
  <p><lb/>Sanguis potest considerari ut Oleum calidum<supplied>.</supplied>
      <lb/>Potest ergo retardare motus Globi aut alius cor<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>poris in ipso dat<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> velocitate incedentis ut Oleum
      <lb/>calidum pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>terpropter. Vide ergo Vir <abbr>Celeberr.</abbr>
      <lb/>annon frustum conicum concavum inveniri possit,
      <lb/>quod inter <choice><orig><g ref="#omn">õ</g></orig><reg>omn</reg></choice>ia eiusdem basis et altitudinis, sangui<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>
<pb facs="1361451" n="3"/>
      <lb break="no"/>ni dat<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> velocitate in ejus concavitatem<del> incidentis</del> inci<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>denti<del> minime</del> ipsi resistat omnium minime.</p>
  <p><lb/>Ceterum quum de <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_M3G2JA79">Fluidis Animalium Sermo</rs> incidit sup<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>pono quod particul<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> illorum Fluidorum moveantur
      <lb/>motu violento idest viribus projicientibus cordis et
      <lb/>canalium in quibus continentur; suppono etiam
      <lb/>dicta Fluida gravia esse ita ut particul<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> eorum ante<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cedentes in suis motibus iuventur a pressione par<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ticularum sibi incumbentium.</p>
  <p><lb/>Monuisti tu<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> eruditiss.<hi rend="sup">a</hi> <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517054805501">epistola</rs> impossibile esse, ut
      <lb/>fluidi <hi rend="u">dat<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> vi</hi> per divers<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> magnitudinis orificia
      <lb/>pulsi<hi rend="u"> <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qualis quantitas <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>quali tempore transeat</hi>. Tibi
      <lb/>gratias ago maximas, et rogo ut mihi sequentem
      <lb/>amoveas difficultatem. <rs key="pers_DE-588-11757645X" type="person">Gulielminus</rs> <rs key="biblio_EAMI3MDF" type="biblio"><choice><orig>de</orig><reg>De</reg></choice> <abbr>sangu.</abbr>
      <lb/>Natura et Constitutione</rs> <abbr>pag.</abbr> 7 ita scribit. <quote type="long"><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>Liquet
      <lb/>enim quod eodem manente diametro Arteri<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Aort<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>,
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>si citius Cor antea laxum contrahatur, necessario velo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>citas egredientis sanguinis maior erit; et e contra,
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>minor, cum in hoc casu velocitas mobilis vi energetic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>moventis debeat commensurari. At si eodem constante
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>in Corde sese constringente, constrictionis tempore, an<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>gustior reperiatur Aort<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> capacitas, oportebit, ut sangui<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>nis velocitas maior sit; necesse est enim ut eodem
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>quo prius tempore, eadem sanguinis quantitas
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>per angustiorem sectionem sive cavitatem tran<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>seat. Sumimus h<choice><orig><g ref="#ihat">î</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>c eandem sanguinis quantitatem
<pb facs="1361452" n="4"/>
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>in qualibet systole a Corde arteriis subministrari;
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>nam si h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c diversa in diversis cordis contractionibus sup<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>poneretur, oporteret et ab illa tanquam a tertia causa
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#quote">„</g></orig><reg/></choice>sanguinis velocitatem auspicari.</quote><note type="comment">Die zitierte Passage steht in der venezianischen Ausgabe von 1701 auf S. 7–8.</note></p>
  <p><lb/>Videtur hic <rs key="pers_DE-588-11757645X" type="person">Gulielminus</rs> asserere eadem vi et eodem
      <lb/>tempore Corde sese constringente, si eadem quantitas
      <lb/>sanguinis effluere debet per arteri<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> angustioris
      <lb/>orificium necesse est ut velocitas sanguinis sit
      <lb/>maior adeoque velocitates in hoc casu arteriarum
      <lb/>sectionibus s<subst><del>i</del><add>u</add></subst>nt reciproc<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>. Videmus etiam
      <lb/>in Aquis currentibus si tempora sint <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qualia,
      <lb/>et quantitates <add>aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></add> effluentis etiam <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>quales in canali
      <lb/>ampliore et angustiore, velocitates orificiis
      <lb/>esse reciprocas. Quomodo ergo est impossibile
      <lb/>ut eadem liquoris quantitas eodem tempore
      <lb/>effluat dat<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> vi maiori celeritate in canali
      <lb/>angustiore, minori in ampliore?</p>
  <p><lb/>Qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ro a Te Vir amicissime fluente quocunque liqui<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>do per canalem conic<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice><figure facs="../images/figures/1361452_01.png" hand="pers_DE-588-102552517"><figDesc>Darstellung einer durch einen konischen Kanal fliessenden Flüssigkeit.</figDesc></figure><figure facs="../images/figures/1361452_02.png" hand="pers_DE-588-102552517"><figDesc>Darstellung einer durch einen zylindrischen Kanal fliessenden Flüssigkeit.</figDesc></figure>
      <lb/><formula>ABDC</formula> ab orificio
      <lb/>ampliori <formula>AB</formula> versus
      <lb/>angustius <formula>DC</formula> secundum parallelas axi <formula>FE</formula>; qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ro
      <lb/>inquam annon istiusmodi Fluidum maiorem im<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>pressionem exercebit in latera canalis conici
      <lb/>quam in latera canalis cylindrici <formula>GHIL</formula> eiusdem
      <lb/>basis et altitudinis, in quo <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>quali vi moveri suppo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>
<pb facs="1361453" n="5"/>
      <lb break="no"/>no idem Fluidum atque eadem celeritate secun<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dum parallelas axi <formula>NM</formula> ab <formula>N</formula> versus <formula>M</formula>. Qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ro
